deployProtocolPrincipal
├── caller lacks bounded operator authority or execution is disabled
│   └── it must reject
├── leg, amount, minimum or deadline is invalid
│   └── it must reject without reassigning capital
├── executor or vault misreports token or ETH movement
│   └── it must revert the entire atomic route
└── exact route succeeds
    ├── only assigned ETH for that leg is consumed
    ├── actual native backing is credited only to its protocol bucket
    └── approvals are cleared and supporter positions are untouched
